<h2>Publikasi Internasional</h2>
Publikasi Internasional.
Dr. Fitri Aulia Permatasari telah mempublikasikan berbagai penelitian di jurnal internasional bereputasi (Q1 - Quartile 1) dengan Impact Factor tinggi, terutama dalam bidang nanomaterials, perovskite solar cells, dan photothermal therapy, beberapa di antaranya, yaitu: Nano Research (2022) – "New Insight into Pyrrolic-N Site Effect towards the First NIR Window Absorption of Pyrrolic-N-rich Carbon Dots.", Scientific Reports (2016) – "Role of C–N Configurations in the Photoluminescence of Graphene Quantum Dots Synthesized by a Hydrothermal Route.", ACS Applied Nanomaterials (2018) – "Design of Pyrrolic-N-Rich Carbon Dots with Absorption in the First Near-Infrared Window for Photothermal Therapy.", Journal of Materials Chemistry C (2022) – "A rational design of carbon dots via the combination of nitrogen and oxygen functional groups towards the first NIR window absorption.", Nanomaterials (2021) – "Carbon-based quantum dots for supercapacitors: Recent advances and future challenges.". Selain publikasi ini, ia juga aktif dalam penelitian terkait solar energy conversion, luminescent nanomaterials, dan perovskite materials, dengan beberapa artikelnya masih dalam proses review di jurnal internasional ternama.
